<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>About Us - OMUNJU SHOPPERS</title>
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/style.css">
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/admin-enhanced.css">
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.0.0/css/all.min.css">
    <style>
        /* About Page Specific Styles */
        .about-hero {
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #34495e, #2c3e50);
            color: white;
            padding: 6rem 0;
            text-align: center;
            margin-bottom: 3rem;
        }

        .about-hero h1 {
            font-size: 4rem;
            margin-bottom: 1rem;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            letter-spacing: 2px;
            text-shadow: 2px 2px 4px rgba(0,0,0,0.3);
        }

        .about-hero p {
            font-size: 1.5rem;
            opacity: 0.9;
            max-width: 800px;
            margin: 0 auto;
        }

        .about-container {
            max-width: 1200px;
            margin: 0 auto;
            padding: 0 2rem;
        }

        /* Company Story Section */
        .company-story-section {
            background: white;
            padding: 4rem 0;
            margin-bottom: 3rem;
        }

        .story-grid {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
            gap: 4rem;
            align-items: center;
        }

        .story-content {
            padding: 2rem;
        }

        .story-title {
            font-size: 2.5rem;
            color: var(--text-color);
            margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
            font-weight: 700;
        }

        .story-text {
            font-size: 1.1rem;
            line-height: 1.8;
            color: #666;
            margin-bottom: 2rem;
        }

        .story-image {
            background: var(--bg-color);
            height: 400px;
            border-radius: 8px;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            color: #666;
            font-size: 1.2rem;
            overflow: hidden;
        }

        .story-image img {
            width: 100%;
            height: 100%;
            object-fit: cover;
        }

        /* Mission & Vision Section */
        .mission-vision-section {
            background: var(--bg-color);
            padding: 4rem 0;
            margin-bottom: 3rem;
        }

        .mission-vision-grid {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(300px, 1fr));
            gap: 2rem;
        }

        .mv-card {
            background: white;
            padding: 3rem;
            border-radius: 8px;
            box-shadow: var(--shadow);
            text-align: center;
            transition: all 0.3s ease;
            border: 2px solid transparent;
        }

        .mv-card:hover {
            transform: translateY(-5px);
            box-shadow: 0 15px 35px rgba(0,0,0,0.15);
            border-color: var(--secondary-color);
        }

        .mv-icon {
            font-size: 3rem;
            color: var(--secondary-color);
            margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
        }

        .mv-title {
            font-size: 1.8rem;
            font-weight: 700;
            color: var(--text-color);
            margin-bottom: 1rem;
        }

        .mv-text {
            color: #666;
            line-height: 1.6;
        }

        /* Team Section */
        .team-section {
            background: white;
            padding: 4rem 0;
            margin-bottom: 3rem;
        }

        .team-grid {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(250px, 1fr));
            gap: 2rem;
        }

        .team-card {
            background: var(--bg-color);
            padding: 2rem;
            border-radius: 8px;
            text-align: center;
            transition: all 0.3s ease;
            border: 2px solid transparent;
        }

        .team-card:hover {
            transform: translateY(-5px);
            box-shadow: 0 10px 25px rgba(0,0,0,0.1);
            border-color: var(--secondary-color);
        }

        .team-image {
            width: 150px;
            height: 150px;
            border-radius: 50%;
            background: #ddd;
            margin: 0 auto 1rem auto;
            overflow: hidden;
            border: 4px solid white;
            box-shadow: 0 4px 15px rgba(0,0,0,0.2);
        }

        .team-image img {
            width: 100%;
            height: 100%;
            object-fit: cover;
        }

        .team-name {
            font-size: 1.3rem;
            font-weight: 700;
            color: var(--text-color);
            margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
        }

        .team-position {
            color: var(--secondary-color);
            font-size: 0.9rem;
            font-weight: 600;
            margin-bottom: 1rem;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            letter-spacing: 1px;
        }

        .team-bio {
            color: #666;
            font-size: 0.9rem;
            line-height: 1.5;
        }

        /* Values Section */
        .values-section {
            background: white;
            padding: 4rem 0;
            margin-bottom: 3rem;
        }

        .values-grid {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(250px, 1fr));
            gap: 2rem;
        }

        .value-card {
            padding: 2rem;
            border-radius: 8px;
            text-align: center;
            transition: all 0.3s ease;
            border: 2px solid transparent;
        }

        .value-card:hover {
            transform: translateY(-5px);
            box-shadow: 0 10px 25px rgba(0,0,0,0.1);
            border-color: var(--secondary-color);
        }

        .value-icon {
            font-size: 3rem;
            color: var(--secondary-color);
            margin-bottom: 1rem;
        }

        .value-title {
            font-size: 1.3rem;
            font-weight: 700;
            color: var(--text-color);
            margin-bottom: 1rem;
        }

        .value-text {
            color: #666;
            line-height: 1.6;
        }

        /* Stats Section */
        .stats-section {
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #3498db, #2980b9);
            color: white;
            padding: 4rem 0;
            margin-bottom: 3rem;
        }

        .stats-grid {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(200px, 1fr));
            gap: 2rem;
            text-align: center;
        }

        .stat-card {
            padding: 2rem;
        }

        .stat-number {
            font-size: 3rem;
            font-weight: bold;
            margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
            display: block;
        }

        .stat-label {
            font-size: 1.1rem;
            opacity: 0.9;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            letter-spacing: 1px;
        }

        /* Testimonials Section */
        .testimonials-section {
            background: white;
            padding: 4rem 0;
            margin-bottom: 3rem;
        }

        .testimonials-grid {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(300px, 1fr));
            gap: 2rem;
        }

        .testimonial-card {
            background: var(--bg-color);
            padding: 2rem;
            border-radius: 8px;
            border-left: 4px solid var(--secondary-color);
        }

        .testimonial-text {
            font-style: italic;
            color: #666;
            margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
            line-height: 1.6;
        }

        .testimonial-author {
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 1rem;
        }

        .author-image {
            width: 50px;
            height: 50px;
            border-radius: 50%;
            background: #ddd;
            overflow: hidden;
        }

        .author-image img {
            width: 100%;
            height: 100%;
            object-fit: cover;
        }

        .author-info h4 {
            margin: 0;
            color: var(--text-color);
            font-size: 1.1rem;
        }

        .author-info p {
            margin: 0;
            color: #999;
            font-size: 0.9rem;
        }

        /* Responsive Design */
        @media (max-width: 768px) {
            .about-hero h1 {
                font-size: 3rem;
            }

            .story-grid {
                grid-template-columns: 1fr;
            }

            .story-image {
                height: 300px;
            }
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <!-- Enhanced Navigation -->
    <%- include('partials/navigation-enhanced', { currentPage: 'about', user: user }) %>

    <!-- About Hero Section -->
    <section class="about-hero">
        <div class="about-container">
            <h1>Our Story</h1>
            <p>Discover the journey behind OMUNJU SHOPPERS and our commitment to providing exceptional shopping experiences</p>
        </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Main Content -->
    <main class="main-content">
        <div class="about-container">
            <!-- Company Story Section -->
            <section class="company-story-section">
                <div class="story-grid">
                    <div class="story-content">
                        <h2 class="story-title">Our Journey</h2>
                        <p class="story-text">
                            Founded in 2024, OMUNJU SHOPPERS began with a simple mission: to revolutionize the way people shop online. 
                            What started as a small e-commerce platform has grown into one of Kenya's most trusted online shopping destinations.
                        </p>
                        <p class="story-text">
                            Our name "OMUNJU" reflects our commitment to bringing the best products to our customers. 
                            From our humble beginnings to our current position as a market leader, we've remained dedicated to quality, 
                            customer service, and innovation.
                        </p>
                        <p class="story-text">
                            Today, we serve thousands of customers across Kenya and beyond, offering a wide range of products 
                            from electronics to fashion, home goods to beauty products. Our team of passionate professionals 
                            works tirelessly to ensure every customer has an exceptional shopping experience.
                        </p>
                    </div>
                    <div class="story-image">
                        <img src="/images/about-hero.jpg" alt="Our Journey">
                    </div>
                </div>
            </section>

            <!-- Mission & Vision Section -->
            <section class="mission-vision-section">
                <div class="mission-vision-grid">
                    <div class="mv-card">
                        <div class="mv-icon">
                            <i class="fas fa-bullseye"></i>
