                        <h3 class="mv-title">Our Mission</h3>
                        <p class="mv-text">
                            To provide our customers with the best online shopping experience by offering high-quality products, 
                            competitive prices, and exceptional customer service. We strive to make shopping convenient, enjoyable, 
                            and accessible to everyone.
                        </p>
                    </div>
                    
                    <div class="mv-card">
                        <div class="mv-icon">
                            <i class="fas fa-eye"></i>
                        </div>
                        <h3 class="mv-title">Our Vision</h3>
                        <p class="mv-text">
                            To become East Africa's most trusted and preferred online shopping destination, 
                            setting new standards for e-commerce excellence and customer satisfaction.
                        </p>
                    </div>
                    
                    <div class="mv-card">
                        <div class="mv-icon">
                            <i class="fas fa-handshake"></i>
                        </div>
                        <h3 class="mv-title">Our Values</h3>
                        <p class="mv-text">
                            Integrity, Innovation, Customer Focus, Quality Excellence, and Social Responsibility guide everything we do.
