                            With over 15 years of experience in e-commerce and retail, John leads our company with vision and dedication.
                        </p>
                    </div>
                    
                    <div class="team-card">
                        <div class="team-image">
                            <img src="/images/team-cto.jpg" alt="CTO">
                        </div>
                        <h4 class="team-name">Jane Smith</h4>
                        <div class="team-position">Chief Technology Officer</div>
                        <p class="team-bio">
                            Jane ensures our platform runs smoothly and implements cutting-edge technology to enhance user experience.
                        </p>
                    </div>
                    
                    <div class="team-card">
                        <div class="team-image">
                            <img src="/images/team-cmo.jpg" alt="CMO">
                        </div>
                        <h4 class="team-name">Mike Johnson</h4>
                        <div class="team-position">Chief Marketing Officer</div>
                        <p class="team-bio">
                            Mike drives our marketing strategies and ensures our brand reaches the right audience.
                        </p>
                    </div>
                    
                    <div class="team-card">
                        <div class="team-image">
                            <img src="/images/team-cso.jpg" alt="CSO">
                        </div>
                        <h4 class="team-name">Sarah Wilson</h4>
                        <div class="team-position">Chief Sales Officer</div>
                        <p class="team-bio">
                            Sarah leads our sales team and focuses on building strong relationships with our customers and partners.
                        </p>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </section>

            <!-- Values Section -->
            <section class="values-section">
                <div class="section-header">
                    <h2 class="section-title">Our Core Values</h2>
                    <p>What drives us every day</p>
                </div>
                
                <div class="values-grid">
                    <div class="value-card">
                        <div class="value-icon">
                            <i class="fas fa-star"></i>
